. Source of funds on file. Everyday Current Account opened as A-6EB01C. Initial deposit M$5,800 posted (D-0001). Deposit is under the M$10,000 LARGE_CASH threshold, so no report is needed.\n\nL-2727 / C-13276 Lucy Taylor: ON HOLD, NOT OPENED. KYC run -> FAILED: date of birth on ID document does not match the application (DOB on file 1992-05-12). Per §2 no account can be opened. The M$3,300 initial deposit was NOT taken. Document request sent to customer for a valid ID with a matching DOB; customer expects to respond in about 4 business days. Customer is keen to open this week, so she should be told the timing may slip. Re-run KYC once corrected documents are in. Customer had a pending \"open this week\" request, which will likely not be met."}},"tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012nstbyDwX7D5naCCeRQa7A","display_name":"End Shift","server_display_name":"sandbank","tool_name":"end_shift"}]}
